# Hosts that reject the link checker rather than actually being broken.
# Keep this list as short as possible — every entry is a link that stops being
# checked. Verify by hand before adding, and prefer fixing the workflow args
# (user-agent, --accept, concurrency) over silencing a host here.
#
# Rate-limited hosts do NOT belong here: 429 is accepted in broken-links.yml,
# so those links are still checked and a real 404 will still fail the build.

linkedin.com
reddit.com

# 403 to any non-browser client, verified by hand (curl with a browser
# user-agent still gets 403; both load fine in a real browser)
statistics.fas.harvard.edu
zhihu.com

# 412 from GitHub Actions runners only — bilibili blocks datacenter IPs.
# Returns 200 from a residential connection with any user-agent.
bilibili.com
